@host = http://localhost:5229

### Opret bruger
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "emre",
  "password": "1234"
}

### Hent alle brugere
GET {{host}}/users

### Hent brugere med filter
GET {{host}}/users?username=em

### Hent en bruger
GET {{host}}/users/1

### Opret post
POST {{host}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First post",
  "body": "Hello world",
  "userId": 1
}

### Hent posts med filter
GET {{host}}/posts?title=first&userId=1

### Opret kommentar
POST {{host}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Nice post",
  "postId": 1,
  "userId": 1
}

### Hent kommentarer med filter
GET {{host}}/comments?postId=1

### Slet kommentar
DELETE {{host}}/comments/1